Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://example.com/npa
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: npa
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: terminal network packet analyzer with anomaly detection
 npa is a Wireshark-lite tool for live capture, protocol decoding
 (Ethernet/802.1Q, IPv4, IPv6, TCP, UDP, ICMP), and rule-driven anomaly
 detection, rendered in an ncurses TUI. It can also read offline pcap files
 and run headless for scripting and CI.
 .
 Live capture requires the CAP_NET_RAW and CAP_NET_ADMIN capabilities; the
 postinst grants them on the installed binary via setcap.
